# Variable names only. Never commit real values.
# The browser build reads only VITE_-prefixed variables.
# Secrets (LLM gateway key, etc.) belong to the backend on the Lightsail host, never here.
#
# VITE_API_BASE_URL is where the browser calls the API, fixed at BUILD time (DECISIONS #119):
#   not set        -> http://127.0.0.1:8000 (local development; leave the line below commented out)
#   a URL          -> that API; cross-origin unless it is the site's own address, so the API's CORS_ALLOWED_ORIGINS must list the site
#   set but EMPTY  -> the page's own origin (relative /api/... calls), for a copy served by Caddy beside the API: one build, any hostname
# An EMPTY value is NOT "unset": do not copy this line uncommented for local development.
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=
